sparky-stereo-browser (@DEBVERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A canvas, video or image with image-rendering: pixelated shows its
    picture: on the Wayland compositor such an image was drawn from an empty
    texture (a black canvas, a green video), and the compositor could not
    scale it nearest-neighbour. It is now drawn by the browser with sharp
    pixels when it is scaled; CesiumJS and three.js pages that set the style
    show their scene again.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  @DATE@
